# `rtok expand -` (T354): agents pipe into it hoping for raw output; nothing reads stdin, so
# a non-id gets a hint at the `expand <id>` trailer instead of a bare unknown-id error.

```console
$ HOME=target/tmp/t354-expand RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t354-expand rtok expand -
? 1
Error: unknown archive id: - (expand takes the hex id from an "expand <id>" trailer; it does not read stdin)

```
